        {
          "name": "createNetScriptStreamDB",
          "declarations": [
            {
              "location": {
                "filename": "file:///C:/Users/ericc/source/repos/netscript-browser-stream-headers-008/packages/fresh/src/runtime/streams/create-stream-db.ts",
                "line": 156,
                "col": 0,
                "byteIndex": 6722
              },
              "declarationKind": "export",
              "jsDoc": {
                "doc": "Create a NetScript-configured TanStack DB-backed StreamDB.\n\nThe returned object has `.collections` — typed TanStack DB `Collection`\ninstances — that update reactively as events arrive from the durable\nstreams server.\nCall the default handle's `preload()` to start consumption. Recoverable\noutages use finite exponential backoff and resume the last consumed batch\nwithout replacing collections. Authentication, malformed data and invalid\nretained offsets enter `failed`; they never trigger a full-log replay.\n`stop()` and `dispose()` cancel reads and backoff and are idempotent.\n",
                "tags": [
                  {
                    "kind": "example",
                    "doc": "```ts\nimport { createNetScriptStreamDB } from '@netscript/fresh/streams';\nimport { useLiveQuery } from '@tanstack/react-db';\nimport { myStreamSchema } from '@app/streams/schemas.ts';\n\nconst db = createNetScriptStreamDB({\n  streamPath: '/my-service/my-stream',\n  schema: myStreamSchema,\n});\nawait db.preload?.();\n\n// In a Preact island:\nconst { data: items } = useLiveQuery((q) =>\n  q.from({ i: db.collections.myEntity })\n);\n```"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "kind": "function",
              "def": {
                "params": [
                  {
                    "kind": "identifier",
                    "name": "options",
                    "optional": false,
                    "tsType": {
                      "repr": "NetScriptStreamDBOptions",
                      "kind": "typeRef",
                      "value": {
                        "typeParams": [
